  <h4>EXPERT, RESEARCH-DRIVEN SERVICES</h4>
  <p>With thousands of new chemicals being developed every year for which little or no health or safety data exists, there has never been a greater need for sound science in addressing the effects of chemical exposure in the workplace. Certified Environmental Management, Ltd. toxicology and risk assessment professionals combine extensive experience, proven methodology, and state-of-the-art techniques to address a host of toxic hazard issues.</p>
  <p>From analyzing existing case studies to developing comprehensive toxicity assessments, we deliver accurate, comprehensive information that helps clients implement hazard control and remediation programs that support a healthy workplace and reduce liability. CEM&#8217;s risk communication approach addresses the perceptions of all stakeholders as well as the scientific facts. Our expertise in risk communication has proven invaluable in increasing understanding, mitigating liability, and resolving conflicts.</p>
